PS5 (ps5webkit GPU=radv only, HANDOVER-radv.md Phase 4; spikes/15-radv-only 15e):
textures over memory another VkDevice of the title allocated (ANGLE's), by
host-pointer import, so that WebGPU takes video frames and hands canvas frames
to the compositor with no CPU copy. New files and a CMake list entry only
(PS5HostPointerTexture.h, vulkan/PS5HostPointerTextureVk.cpp): nothing that
exists changes behaviour. Applied by port/deps/build.sh dawn-radv only, which
installs into its own prefix (toolchain/wpe-deps/install/dawn-radv); the
release builds' Dawn (port/deps/build.sh dawn, the sysroot) never has it.

